{"summary":"Relaxing puzzle-solving and life-sim meet in a cozy, no-combat, coyote adventure","description":"Lonesome Village is a cozy, quiet town struggling to rebuild after a strange calamity wiped out their homes.\n\nTake the role of Wes, the coyote, and help bring this village back from the brink of destruction in a puzzle-filled life sim!\n\nGame Features:\n\n+ Gorgeous, inviting art style - Lonesome Village is the perfect place to rest up after a long day of adventuring.\n+ Discover a detailed and fascinating world full of mystery and adventure.\n+Solve mind-bending puzzles to gain entry to and make your way up a mysterious magic tower, one dungeon at a time.\n+ Hang out and make friends with a variety of cute characters.\n+ Save villagers from a perilous stay in the tower and help bring them back home to Lonesome!\n+ Make Lonesome your home - earn land in the village and build and customize your house inside and out.\n+ Help Lonesome grow by working in your garden and fishing in the nearby lakes.\n+ Discover the gripping story of Lonesome’s origins and learn about Wes's secret past.\n\nOgre Pixel\n2024","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-h2zyprz0Sk?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qRg9tEAcH_eaE3vaCwRgJ18XtagQ0ihU2397LYQPIVYhBxxtfvdV1K5ho0ZpEWtQC8KEP8wnT6McCqRm_3pZ","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/BNOhlArthiX-MIi9zo9cfuM1sB01zfstaltqxuWpqKyL19iVw2KanO_E0zwEOzMtJDHsE11jDEgOI2EHgwv1","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Grwn-mekWDC8MUbpN49kWXXX_2ZbpCf12hxve2atBLJoPuzmNUrlrunZpMh0TuGfpaDYu5JEIpwE7-8b3cImSA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/Z53FsLqj1fnlipnmYH_hFTA7t7h2BiMMexGElbfQc82AoFCgYty5podWp5I7P1ZXRMW9TQ_APS4LWFTx0JVLwA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/C6fVzhRnvZSbsJmF8-qdvQwmo4u3aBxzELuyC0GvnOv09dif0dliiTddqYSIa24CqajetbwL1RYe1cPh9ZoqxA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/t7JceuI-NWoTh-QHjW8ctO-RzFxLnlYE_G5xY